        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 33</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXXVII} Cyninges horswealh, se ðe him mæge geærendian: ðæs wergield bið CC sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A Welsh horseman in the king’s service who can act as his courier: his wergild is 200 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">The wergeld of a Welsh horseman who is in the king's service and can ride on his errands shall be 200 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Cyninges horswealh, se ðe him mæge geærndian, ðes wer(egild) is CC hund scll'.</ab>
